id: TEST-029
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Meaningless test name (test1, works, should work)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .tsx .jsx .py .java .go
  exclude_paths: vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: test
patterns:
  - regex: (it|test)\(['"](?:test\s*\d+|works|should work|it works|test|check|verify|ok)['"]\s*,
    message: "Meaningless test name — test names should describe the expected behavior"
  - regex: def\s+test_\d+\s*\(
    message: "Numbered test name (test_1) — describe the expected behavior instead"
  - regex: func\s+Test[A-Z]\w*\d+\s*\(
    message: "Numbered Go test — describe the scenario being tested"
fix: Name tests by behavior. 'should return 404 when user not found' instead of 'test1' or 'works'.
